      "regions": [
        {
          "id": "text-title",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 45,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 22px\">CONTROL DE FLUJO Y BUCLES</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-note-1",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 105,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p>Condicionales y bucles funcionales. El rango de los bucles es inclusivo.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-if",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 170,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{if}\\left(2<3,10,20\\right)",
          "ascii": "if(2 < 3, 10, 20)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-n",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 240,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "n\\coloneq5",
          "ascii": "n := 5"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-if-n",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 310,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{if}\\left(n>3,100,0\\right)",
          "ascii": "if(n > 3, 100, 0)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-for",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 380,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{for}\\left(i,1,5,i^{2}\\right)",
          "ascii": "for(i, 1, 5, i^2)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-sum",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 450,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{sum}\\left(i,1,n,i^{2}\\right)",
          "ascii": "sum(i, 1, n, i^2)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-product",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 520,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{product}\\left(i,1,5,i\\right)",
          "ascii": "product(i, 1, 5, i)"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-note-2",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 595,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p>La variable <strong>i</strong> es local al bucle y no modifica una variable con el mismo nombre fuera de él.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-if-inside",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 660,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{sum}\\left(i,1,10,\\text{if}\\left(i>5,i,0\\right)\\right)",
          "ascii": "sum(i, 1, 10, if(i > 5, i, 0))"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-note-3",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 735,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p><strong>if</strong> evalúa solo la rama elegida. Los bucles están limitados a 100.000 iteraciones.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-line",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 800,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{line}\\left(x\\coloneq0,\\text{while}\\left(x<5,x\\coloneq x+1\\right),x\\right)",
          "ascii": "line(x := 0, while(x < 5, x := x + 1), x)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-for-matrix",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 870,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{for}\\left(v,\\left[1,2,3\\right],v^{2}\\right)",
          "ascii": "for(v, [1,2,3], v^2)"
        },
        {
          "id": "math-sum-matrix",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 940,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{sum}\\left(v,\\left[1,2,3\\right],v\\right)",
          "ascii": "sum(v, [1,2,3], v)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}